# November 24, 2026: Douglas County, Kansas, a second pass (Lawrence, Baldwin City, Vinland, Lecompton and the farm country
# between). Drawn from the Kansas and National Registers for Douglas County: the listed buildings the first pass did not reach.
# Facts from the linked sources only: National Register forms read as text from NPGallery (tools/page.py), the Kansas Historical
# Society's register summaries, and Lawrence Journal-World articles. A form says what the building was like the year it was
# written, so each entry says which year that was; none of these buildings was seen on the ground. Pins were checked on the
# Kansas state aerial.
